VERSION 5.8 ;
DIVIDERCHAR "/" ;
BUSBITCHARS "[]" ;
DESIGN tiny ;
UNITS DISTANCE MICRONS 1000 ;

DIEAREA ( 0 0 ) ( 6000 6000 ) ;

ROW ROW_0 core 0 0 N DO 30 BY 1 STEP 200 0 ;
ROW ROW_1 core 0 2000 FS DO 30 BY 1 STEP 200 0 ;
ROW ROW_2 core 0 4000 N DO 20 BY 1 STEP 200 0 ;

TRACKS Y 100 DO 30 STEP 200 LAYER M1 ;
TRACKS X 100 DO 30 STEP 200 LAYER M2 ;
TRACKS Y 200 DO 15 STEP 400 LAYER M3 ;

GCELLGRID X 0 DO 4 STEP 2000 ;

VIAS 1 ;
    - M1M2_2CUT + VIARULE M1M2GEN + CUTSIZE 100 100
      + LAYERS M1 V1 M2 + CUTSPACING 100 100
      + ENCLOSURE 0 50 0 50 + ROWCOL 1 2 ;
END VIAS

COMPONENTS 8 ;
- u1 INV + PLACED ( 200 0 ) N ;
- u2 INV + PLACED ( 1000 2000 ) FS ;
- u3 NAND2 + FIXED ( 2000 0 ) N + SOURCE DIST ;
- u4 NAND2
  + PLACED ( 3000 2000 ) FS ;
- u5 INV ;
- u6 NAND2 + UNPLACED ;
- ram0 RAM + FIXED ( 4000 0 ) N ;
- u7 INV + PLACED ( 600 4000 ) S ;
END COMPONENTS

PINS 2 ;
- in + NET in + DIRECTION INPUT + USE SIGNAL
  + LAYER M2 ( -50 0 ) ( 50 200 ) + FIXED ( 1100 6000 ) S ;
- out + NET out + DIRECTION OUTPUT + USE SIGNAL
    + PORT
      + LAYER M3 ( -100 -100 ) ( 100 100 )
      + PLACED ( 6000 3100 ) W ;
END PINS

SPECIALNETS 1 ;
- VDD ( * VDD ) + USE POWER
  + ROUTED M1 200 + SHAPE FOLLOWPIN ( 0 2000 ) ( 6000 * )
  NEW M3 400 + SHAPE STRIPE ( 5000 0 ) ( * 6000 )
  NEW M1 0 ( 4800 4000 ) M1M2_2CUT ;
END SPECIALNETS

NETS 5 ;
- in ( PIN in ) ( u1 A ) + USE SIGNAL ;
- n1 ( u1 Y ) ( u3 A ) ( u2 A ) ;
- n2 ( u2 Y ) ( u3 B ) ( u4 A ) + WEIGHT 2 ;
- n3 ( u3 Y ) ( u4 B ) ( ram0 D ) ( u5 A ) ( u6 A ) ( u7 A )
  + ROUTED M1 ( 2500 1000 ) ( 2700 * ) M1M2
  NEW M2 ( 2700 1000 ) ( 2700 3500 ) M2M3
  NEW M3 ( 2700 3500 ) ( 5000 3500 ) ;
- out ( u4 Y ) ( PIN out ) ;
END NETS

END DESIGN
